{"id":"0b2c86dbc4b75e04","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-filter7-convergent-ultrafilter.md","title":"ZFC Filter7 Convergent Ultrafilter","display":"df-zfc-filter7-convergent-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter7 Convergent Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter7-convergent-ultrafilter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter7-convergent-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter7-convergent-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter7 Convergent Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter7-convergent-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-convergent-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter7-convergent-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter7 Convergent Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> (ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ConvergentUltrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ConvergentUltrafilter}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}convergent\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ConvergentUltrafilter}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal U,x)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\in\\mathcal U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}convergent\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ConvergentUltrafilter}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal U,x)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\in\\mathcal U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ultrafilter clause now uses the canonical set-ultrafilter predicate instead of an undeclared spelling variant.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ConvergentUltrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}convergent\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7ConvergentUltrafilter}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal U,x)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\in\\mathcal U)","display":true}],"bytes":1182,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1915","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-filter7-convergent-ultrafilter.md|58-df-zfc-filter7-convergent-ultrafilter]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","815e63e5071e7b58"]}